  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u7ac3add9\" id=\"u7ac3add9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1785077349388-f0bf287a-64f4-4bf5-8475-7b83df190bbe.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A817%2C%22originHeight%22%3A288%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23035ab0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B4N6t%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"hvn1o\" id=\"hvn1o\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2939c5e\" id=\"ua2939c5e\">Linux指令调用</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1b3d6a08\" id=\"u1b3d6a08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46b4ce7d\" id=\"u46b4ce7d\">执行如下命令可以读取</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d142a26\" id=\"u5d142a26\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub69415f5\" id=\"ub69415f5\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6fa3c73\" id=\"ub6fa3c73\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub99b9ed1\" id=\"ub99b9ed1\">按照下面的配置，我们可以配置当前用户具备操作GPIO的权限，避免我们在后续的操作中频繁授权。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%20udev%20%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cnsudo%20nano%20%2Fetc%2Fudev%2Frules.d%2F99-gpio.rules%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e3EzD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u867706bb\" id=\"u867706bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud38a758b\" id=\"ud38a758b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">添加以下内容：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SUBSYSTEM%3D%3D%5C%22gpio%5C%22%2C%20KERNEL%3D%3D%5C%22gpiochip*%5C%22%2C%20GROUP%3D%5C%22dialout%5C%22%2C%20MODE%3D%5C%220660%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G3D5H%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u58f820ae\" id=\"u58f820ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf446f39\" id=\"udf446f39\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">保存后，重新加载 udev 规则：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20udevadm%20control%20--reload-rules%5Cnsudo%20udevadm%20trigger%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sKdE6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub3aa5f67\" id=\"ub3aa5f67\"><span data-lake-id=\"u512dd802\" id=\"u512dd802\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">然后将你的用户加入</span><span data-lake-id=\"u862eed1b\" id=\"u862eed1b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3c1f43a7\" id=\"u3c1f43a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8eacf6bf\" id=\"u8eacf6bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21); background-color: rgb(235, 238, 242)\">dialout</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"udf6ee1d5\" id=\"udf6ee1d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u71b87b91\" id=\"u71b87b91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">组：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22shell%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20usermod%20-aG%20dialout%20%24USER%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WB3X3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf60bead5\" id=\"uf60bead5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7655bbdd\" id=\"u7655bbdd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">重启系统</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufeb32652\" id=\"ufeb32652\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">后生效。 或者退出当前系统，再重新登录</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5f4c506e\" id=\"u5f4c506e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u761a1c9c\" id=\"u761a1c9c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1785419612018-2897c7f3-1c69-4252-aea0-3ccab04ae662.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6d7124de-4aab-4440-9549-0dafd784f7d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ufd85cb0c-1c84-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A714.4%2C%22height%22%3A398%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A66110%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A893%2C%22originHeight%22%3A497%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A317%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A241%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80U%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A74%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A45%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PC12%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A59%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210KO%22%2C%22x%22%3A724%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B3%E8%84%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A127%2C%22y%22%3A140%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A784%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210KA%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PC%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R2%22%2C%22x%22%3A723%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A338%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A685%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B7%A6%E8%84%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A139%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A782%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GND%22%2C%22x%22%3A337%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23faf4f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua7170da6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7bd12752\" id=\"u7bd12752\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u006e88d6\" id=\"u006e88d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u717da118\" id=\"u717da118\">在linux开发中，我们想去控制引脚，就需要知道引脚的编号。它的计算公式如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3782b58e\" id=\"u3782b58e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueac6ee9f\" id=\"ueac6ee9f\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u717fa34d\" id=\"u717fa34d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57599967\" id=\"u57599967\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">全局编号 = Port字母索引 × 32 + 引脚号</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14e22d23\" id=\"u14e22d23\"><span data-lake-id=\"uabfc5a44\" id=\"uabfc5a44\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u18068863\" id=\"u18068863\"><span data-lake-id=\"u288541a5\" id=\"u288541a5\">例如查看电路图，我们知道PC7控制的是右脚，PC12控制的是左脚，那么他们的引脚编号对应按照如下规则计算：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u48136478\" id=\"u48136478\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38583678\" id=\"u38583678\">A = 0  B= 1 C=2  D=3 E=4</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u352c351e\" id=\"u352c351e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59c37ed1\" id=\"u59c37ed1\">套用上面的的公式，所以PC7引脚编号计算如下</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u59a9bd64\" id=\"u59a9bd64\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3ff6c3e\" id=\"ua3ff6c3e\">PC7 = 2 x 32 + 7 = 71</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9f75ce22\" id=\"u9f75ce22\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub280e82e\" id=\"ub280e82e\">PC12 = 2x 32 + 12 = 76</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u76878997\" id=\"u76878997\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc81fe96\" id=\"ucc81fe96\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8cb12dd8\" id=\"u8cb12dd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7fa7c268\" id=\"u7fa7c268\">知道了引脚的编号之后，我们还需要知道该引脚属于哪一个GPIO控制器，我们可以在命令行中输入如下命令：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20gpioinfo%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22contain%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kz4J9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22contain%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uee8ecbcc\" id=\"uee8ecbcc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc969cf91\" id=\"uc969cf91\">我们可以看到如下输出：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gpiochip0%20-%2032%20lines%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%200%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20kernel%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%20%5Bused%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%201%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20kernel%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%20%5Bused%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%202%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%203%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%204%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%205%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%206%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn...........................%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5N%E8%A1%8C.........................%5Cngpiochip1%20-%20288%20lines%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%200%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%201%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%202%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%203%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%204%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%205%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%206%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%207%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%208%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%20%209%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%2010%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20line%20%2011%3A%20%20%20%20%20%20unnamed%20%20%20%20%20%20%20unused%20%20%20input%20%20active-high%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a9cxr%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u65e589af\" id=\"u65e589af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u571b88ce\" id=\"u571b88ce\">通过上面的输出我们可以看出gpiochip0 管理的编号是0-31， gpiochip1管理的是0-287， 我们要的71和76都在gpiochip1上</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua7dd02e1\" id=\"ua7dd02e1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc72fd267\" id=\"uc72fd267\">执行如下命令，可以读取引脚的状态</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gpioget%20gpiochip1%2071%2076%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lllzY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2f235db4\" id=\"u2f235db4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufba5bd29\" id=\"ufba5bd29\">默认输出：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qu3p1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uef06facc\" id=\"uef06facc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c1cd904\" id=\"u3c1cd904\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">按下其中任意一直鸭脚，再次执行命令，看看状态是否会发生变化</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"I8YOj\" id=\"I8YOj\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub28fe8d0\" id=\"ub28fe8d0\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">代码驱动</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u47311370\" id=\"u47311370\"><span data-lake-id=\"uadb3b3ea\" id=\"uadb3b3ea\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u869d3925\" id=\"u869d3925\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucfff9863\" id=\"ucfff9863\">安装依赖</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20lgpio%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MIE76%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20lgpio%5Cnimport%20time%5Cn%5CnLEFT_GPIO_CHIP%20%3D%201%5CnRIGHT_GPIO_CHIP%20%3D%201%5CnLEFT_FOOT_LINE%20%3D%2071%20%20%20%23%20PC7%5CnRIGHT_FOOT_LINE%20%3D%2076%20%20%23%20PC12%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20FeetContacts%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.left_handle%20%3D%20lgpio.gpiochip_open(LEFT_GPIO_CHIP)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.right_handle%20%3D%20lgpio.gpiochip_open(RIGHT_GPIO_CHIP)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpio_claim_input(self.left_handle%2C%20LEFT_FOOT_LINE)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20except%20Exception%20as%20e%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20raise%20RuntimeError(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20f%5C%22Failed%20to%20claim%20PC7%20on%20gpiochip%7BLEFT_GPIO_CHIP%7D%20line%20%7BLEFT_FOOT_LINE%7D%3A%20%7Be%7D%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%20from%20e%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpio_claim_input(self.right_handle%2C%20RIGHT_FOOT_LINE)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20except%20Exception%20as%20e%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20raise%20RuntimeError(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20f%5C%22Failed%20to%20claim%20PC12%20on%20gpiochip%7BRIGHT_GPIO_CHIP%7D%20line%20%7BRIGHT_FOOT_LINE%7D%3A%20%7Be%7D%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20)%20from%20e%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20get(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20left%20%3D%20not%20bool(lgpio.gpio_read(self.left_handle%2C%20LEFT_FOOT_LINE))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20right%20%3D%20not%20bool(lgpio.gpio_read(self.right_handle%2C%20RIGHT_FOOT_LINE))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%5Bleft%2C%20right%5D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20stop(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20hasattr(lgpio%2C%20%5C%22gpio_free%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpio_free(self.left_handle%2C%20LEFT_FOOT_LINE)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpio_free(self.right_handle%2C%20RIGHT_FOOT_LINE)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpiochip_close(self.left_handle)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lgpio.gpiochip_close(self.right_handle)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20%5C%22__main__%5C%22%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20feet_contacts%20%3D%20FeetContacts()%5Cn%20%20%20%20try%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20while%20True%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20print(feet_contacts.get())%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20time.sleep(0.05)%5Cn%20%20%20%20finally%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20feet_contacts.stop()%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nZHJ7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1d9351b5\" id=\"u1d9351b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9dfb4a96\" id=\"u9dfb4a96\">可能存在的问题，如果你出现了下面的错误，极大概率是你没有对设备进行授权</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22File%20%5C%22%2Fhome%2Fkickpi%2FDocuments%2F.openduck%2Flib%2Fpython3.12%2Fsite-packages%2Flgpio.py%5C%22%2C%20line%20458%2C%20in%20_u2i%5Cn%20%20%20%20raise%20error(error_text(v))%5Cnlgpio.error%3A%20'can%20not%20open%20gpiochip'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UO4qS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20%2Fhome%2Fkickpi%2FDocuments%2F.openduck%2Fbin%2Fpython3%20feet_contacts.py%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aaLfv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufd9586f4\" id=\"ufd9586f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue31c7ae6\" id=\"ue31c7ae6\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u24e8177f\" id=\"u24e8177f\"> </span></p>",
